silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_01_reader_onboarding_sections_01_what_the_encyclopedia_is_concrete_anchor_8 silm:hasExample "In '01WhatTheEncyclopediaIsConcreteAnchor8', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the running fixture vet record about Mittens (date, veterinarian, fees)." .
